{"id":"2ed5fae1d0439ed4","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-rule-check.md","title":"Rule Check Predicate","display":"df-rule-check — Rule Check Predicate","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-rule-check","aliases":["92-df-rule-check"],"display":"df-rule-check — Rule Check Predicate","depends_on":["[[92-df-inference-rule]]","[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-g-system]]","[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","[[92-df-arithmetization-steps]]"],"source":"第 III 章 p. 35（PDF 52）","source_status":"原书规则检验的本地编码实现"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-rule-check"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-rule-check</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-rule-check — Rule Check Predicate"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5efcbe99d24a5bd9\" href=\"?note=5efcbe99d24a5bd9\" title=\"92-df-inference-rule\">92-df-inference-rule</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"573d6ccf155d773c\" href=\"?note=573d6ccf155d773c\" title=\"92-df-arithmetization-steps\">92-df-arithmetization-steps</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 III 章 p. 35（PDF 52）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书规则检验的本地编码实现"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(\\Sigma_G,A_G,R_G)\">\\(G=(\\Sigma_G,A_G,R_G)\\)</span> (system G, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (formula set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_G\\subseteq\\mathrm{InfRule}_G\">\\(R_G\\subseteq\\mathrm{InfRule}_G\\)</span> (system-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> rule-instance set and its ambient space, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5efcbe99d24a5bd9\" href=\"?note=5efcbe99d24a5bd9\" title=\"92-df-inference-rule\">92-df-inference-rule</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\\)</span> (Gödel numbering, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SeqCode}\">\\(\\mathrm{SeqCode}\\)</span> (finite-sequence encoder, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"573d6ccf155d773c\" href=\"?note=573d6ccf155d773c\" title=\"92-df-arithmetization-steps\">92-df-arithmetization-steps</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u,m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(u,m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> (codes of the premise sequence and conclusion)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RuleCheck}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{RuleCheck}_G\\)</span> (definition-target rule-check predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rule\\text{-}check}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RuleCheck}_G(u,m)\\Longleftrightarrow\nR_G\\subseteq\\mathrm{InfRule}_G\\land\n\\exists r\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists(\\varphi_1,\\ldots,\\varphi_r)\\in(\\mathrm{Fml}_G)^r\\;\n\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\\Bigl(\nu=\\mathrm{SeqCode}(\\langle\\ulcorner\\varphi_1\\urcorner,\\ldots,\n\\ulcorner\\varphi_r\\urcorner\\rangle)\\land m=\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner\n\\land(\\langle\\varphi_1,\\ldots,\\varphi_r\\rangle,\\psi)\\in R_G\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rule\\text{-}check}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RuleCheck}_G(u,m)\\Longleftrightarrow\nR_G\\subseteq\\mathrm{InfRule}_G\\land\n\\exists r\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists(\\varphi_1,\\ldots,\\varphi_r)\\in(\\mathrm{Fml}_G)^r\\;\n\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\\Bigl(\nu=\\mathrm{SeqCode}(\\langle\\ulcorner\\varphi_1\\urcorner,\\ldots,\n\\ulcorner\\varphi_r\\urcorner\\rangle)\\land m=\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner\n\\land(\\langle\\varphi_1,\\ldots,\\varphi_r\\rangle,\\psi)\\in R_G\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>规则检验谓词：判断推理步骤是否正确</li>\n<li>检验 Modus Ponens 时，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 编码前提码序列\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner,\\ulcorner\\varphi\\to\\psi\\urcorner\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner,\\ulcorner\\varphi\\to\\psi\\urcorner\\rangle\\)</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner\">\\(m=\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner\\)</span></li>\n<li>检验全称概括时，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 编码单元素前提码序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\rangle\\)</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=\\ulcorner\\forall x\\,\\varphi\\urcorner\">\\(m=\\ulcorner\\forall x\\,\\varphi\\urcorner\\)</span></li>\n<li>对本书固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_G=\\mathrm{MP}\\cup\\mathrm{Gen}\">\\(R_G=\\mathrm{MP}\\cup\\mathrm{Gen}\\)</span> 与有效编码，可进一步证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RuleCheck}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{RuleCheck}_G\\)</span> 是 PR 谓词；该有效性不是任意规则集自动具有的</li>\n<li>规则检验是证明验证的基本步骤</li>\n<li>与公理码检验及逐行前提索引检查合并后可构成证明码验证器；不能只把两个布尔谓词并列就省略证明序列的先行行约束</li>\n<li>算术化中的关键组件</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>原书 MP(x,y,z) 使用 y=imp(x,z)，Gen(x,z) 使用存在变量码，二者都在原书十三进制文法上。本文参数是 G 的前提码序列、结论码，规则验算不能跨两套编号直接互换。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-inference-rule","status":"resolved","id":"5efcbe99d24a5bd9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-inference-rule]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-g-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-arithmetization-steps","status":"resolved","id":"573d6ccf155d773c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-arithmetization-steps]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G=(\\Sigma_G,A_G,R_G)$ (system G, see [[92-df-g-system]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_G$ (formula set, see [[92-df-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-inference-rule","status":"resolved","id":"5efcbe99d24a5bd9","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$R_G\\subseteq\\mathrm{InfRule}_G$ (system-$G$ rule-instance set and its ambient space, see [[92-df-inference-rule]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner$ (Gödel numbering, see [[92-df-godel-numbering]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-arithmetization-steps","status":"resolved","id":"573d6ccf155d773c","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SeqCode}$ (finite-sequence encoder, see [[92-df-arithmetization-steps]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G=(\\Sigma_G,A_G,R_G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"R_G\\subseteq\\mathrm{InfRule}_G","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SeqCode}","display":false},{"tex":"u,m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RuleCheck}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rule\\text{-}check}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RuleCheck}_G(u,m)\\Longleftrightarrow\nR_G\\subseteq\\mathrm{InfRule}_G\\land\n\\exists r\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists(\\varphi_1,\\ldots,\\varphi_r)\\in(\\mathrm{Fml}_G)^r\\;\n\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\\Bigl(\nu=\\mathrm{SeqCode}(\\langle\\ulcorner\\varphi_1\\urcorner,\\ldots,\n\\ulcorner\\varphi_r\\urcorner\\rangle)\\land m=\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner\n\\land(\\langle\\varphi_1,\\ldots,\\varphi_r\\rangle,\\psi)\\in R_G\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner,\\ulcorner\\varphi\\to\\psi\\urcorner\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"m=\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"m=\\ulcorner\\forall x\\,\\varphi\\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"R_G=\\mathrm{MP}\\cup\\mathrm{Gen}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RuleCheck}_G","display":false}],"bytes":2517,"backlinks":[{"id":"bf315ef87cd91c88","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-152","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-rule-check]]"}],"outgoing":["5efcbe99d24a5bd9","5a1bd470754681a7","e0eabee5d77258a7","2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","573d6ccf155d773c"]}